{:edb/db-before-t 565 :edb/db-after-t 566 :edb/tx-data [[13194139533878 50 #inst "2026-10-05T06:51:13.979Z" 13194139533878 true] [17592186083155 1020 #edb/ref 17592186262955 13194139533878 true] [17592186083155 1020 #edb/ref 17592186262962 13194139533878 true] [17592186083155 1020 #edb/ref 17592186262973 13194139533878 true] [17592186083155 1020 #edb/ref 17592186262976 13194139533878 true] [17592186083155 1020 #edb/ref 17592186262983 13194139533878 true] [17592186083158 1020 #edb/ref 17592186262934 13194139533878 true] [17592186083158 1020 #edb/ref 17592186262941 13194139533878 true] [17592186083158 1020 #edb/ref 17592186262948 13194139533878 true] [17592186083158 1020 #edb/ref 17592186262969 13194139533878 true] [17592186083522 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139533878 true] [17592186083522 1145 "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{{y}^{′}(t)}{{x}^{′}(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=-\\frac{1}{4}{t}^{-3/2},\\,{y}^{′}(t)=\\frac{2t{e}^{t}-2{e}^{t}}{4{t}^{2}}=\\frac{{e}^{t}(t-1)}{2{t}^{2}}.\n$$\n\n \n\nSo we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{{e}^{t}(t-1)}{2{t}^{2}}\\cdot (-4{t}^{3/2}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2{e}^{t}(t-1)}{\\sqrt{t}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, when $t=5,$ the slope of the tangent to the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =-\\,\\frac{2{e}^{5}(5-1)}{\\sqrt{5}} \\\\  & =-\\,\\frac{2{e}^{5}\\cdot 4}{\\sqrt{5}} \\\\  & =-\\,\\frac{8{e}^{5}}{\\sqrt{5}}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262934 1017 #edb/ref 17592186262935 13194139533878 true] [17592186262934 1089 "q-102922" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262934 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533878 true] [17592186262934 1100 "For the parametric curve \n\n$$\nx=\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t,\\,y={sin}^{2}⁡t,\\,0\\le t<2\\pi ,\n$$\n\ncalculate the slope of the tangent to the curve at the point where $t=\\frac{\\pi }{12}.$" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262934 1113 #uuid "3a94c8b6-af79-5573-a1c6-6e6e990a28cb" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262934 1145 "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{{y}^{′}(t)}{{x}^{′}(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t,\\,{y}^{′}(t)=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t=\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t.\n$$\n\n \n\nSo we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t}{2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{tan}⁡2t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, when $t=\\frac{\\pi }{12},$ the slope of the tangent to the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{tan}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{12}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262935 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262936 13194139533878 true] [17592186262935 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262937 13194139533878 true] [17592186262935 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262938 13194139533878 true] [17592186262935 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262939 13194139533878 true] [17592186262935 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262940 13194139533878 true] [17592186262935 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533878 true] [17592186262935 1041 "selection" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262935 1104 #edb/ref 17592186262939 13194139533878 true] [17592186262935 1110 #uuid "963457c2-cfbd-557d-bf67-09ed76aa13de" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262936 1034 "\\sqrt{3}" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262936 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533878 true] [17592186262936 1111 #uuid "35fd903a-d729-526b-bb61-9607a7ea00fc" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262937 1034 "-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6}" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262937 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533878 true] [17592186262937 1111 #uuid "65e7f290-b617-5197-a61e-57d0ea809855" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262938 1034 "-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262938 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533878 true] [17592186262938 1111 #uuid "788d8d49-dce4-50ed-af51-f63d12773e6b" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262939 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6}" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262939 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533878 true] [17592186262939 1111 #uuid "ec559a54-c83a-548a-b6cd-9cf419698065" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262940 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262940 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533878 true] [17592186262940 1111 #uuid "945e0974-538c-534c-8e64-b72277388871" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262941 1017 #edb/ref 17592186262942 13194139533878 true] [17592186262941 1089 "q-15465" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262941 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533878 true] [17592186262941 1100 "For the parametric curve \n\n$$\nx=t+\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,y=t+\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,0\\le t<2\\pi ,\n$$\n\ncalculate the slope of the tangent to the curve at the point where $t=\\frac{\\pi }{2}.$" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262941 1113 #uuid "16fc9f31-33f6-5972-9529-3afa5f1e1dc8" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262941 1145 "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{{y}^{′}(t)}{{x}^{′}(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=1+\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,{y}^{′}(t)=1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t.\n$$\n\n \n\nSo we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t}{1+\\operatorname{cos}⁡t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, when $t=\\frac{\\pi }{2},$ the slope of the tangent to the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})}{1+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-1}{1+0} \\\\  & =0\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262942 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262943 13194139533878 true] [17592186262942 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262944 13194139533878 true] [17592186262942 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262945 13194139533878 true] [17592186262942 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262946 13194139533878 true] [17592186262942 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262947 13194139533878 true] [17592186262942 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533878 true] [17592186262942 1041 "selection" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262942 1104 #edb/ref 17592186262947 13194139533878 true] [17592186262942 1110 #uuid "9959376b-5bc9-5d3a-9579-da6049626b2b" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262943 1034 "\\sqrt{2}" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262943 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533878 true] [17592186262943 1111 #uuid "a9a4279b-0f5c-5b97-9e83-b00052f39697" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262944 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262944 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533878 true] [17592186262944 1111 #uuid "92aa918d-c8de-5fbe-9553-727cd6f9c9fd" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262945 1034 "1" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262945 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533878 true] [17592186262945 1111 #uuid "323a20cf-27d3-5675-88ae-ee3868536fac" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262946 1034 "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262946 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533878 true] [17592186262946 1111 #uuid "0437357f-68d7-5270-8cfd-e7be653596c1" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262947 1034 "0" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262947 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533878 true] [17592186262947 1111 #uuid "3a692b14-0543-5852-9204-5dce1f445d61" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262948 1017 #edb/ref 17592186262949 13194139533878 true] [17592186262948 1089 "q-15475" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262948 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139533878 true] [17592186262948 1100 "For the parametric curve \n\n$$\nx={e}^{1/t},\\,y=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{t}^{2}-1}},\\,1<t<\\infty ,\n$$\n\ncalculate the slope of the tangent to the curve at the point where $t=2.$" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262948 1113 #uuid "56044f7d-8044-5dcb-9e59-27af5ccb11e6" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262948 1145 "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{{y}^{′}(t)}{{x}^{′}(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}{e}^{1/t},\\,{y}^{′}(t)=-\\frac{t}{({t}^{2}-1)^{3/2}}.\n$$\n\n \n\nSo we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{(-\\frac{t}{({t}^{2}-1)^{3/2}})}{(-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}{e}^{1/t})} \\\\  & =\\frac{{t}^{3}{e}^{-1/t}}{({t}^{2}-1)^{3/2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, when $t=2,$ the slope of the tangent to the curve is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =\\frac{{2}^{3}{e}^{-1/2}}{({2}^{2}-1)^{3/2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{{3}^{3/2}\\sqrt{e}} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{27e}}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262949 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262950 13194139533878 true] [17592186262949 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262951 13194139533878 true] [17592186262949 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262952 13194139533878 true] [17592186262949 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262953 13194139533878 true] [17592186262949 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262954 13194139533878 true] [17592186262949 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533878 true] [17592186262949 1041 "selection" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262949 1104 #edb/ref 17592186262952 13194139533878 true] [17592186262949 1110 #uuid "ca4903a3-8a91-5e14-a591-a110458c9f28" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262950 1034 "\\sqrt{\\frac{8e}{27}}" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262950 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533878 true] [17592186262950 1111 #uuid "2fc57ba9-c166-5c1e-837f-4646755994d3" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262951 1034 "\\sqrt{\\frac{9}{8e}}" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262951 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533878 true] [17592186262951 1111 #uuid "48c7f3ca-6131-550c-8143-08ab3e1a15c6" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262952 1034 "\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{27e}}" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262952 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533878 true] [17592186262952 1111 #uuid "7c99c21d-890e-534d-84e3-a21b6c050b2f" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262953 1034 "\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{9e}}" 13194139533878 true] [17592186262953 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533878 true] [17592186262953 1111 #uuid "434a3446-cd9c-57c9-938d-f0b5366df13f" 13194